{"id":"5d1125f04599dad7","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-tychonoff.md","title":"Tychonoff's Theorem","display":"thm-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-tychonoff","aliases":["58-thm-tychonoff","58-df-tychonoff"],"display":"thm-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-tychonoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-tychonoff</span><span>58-df-tychonoff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tychonoff — Tychonoff's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec\\tau(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau)\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec\\tau(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau)\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This theorem is stated in the present ZFC context; over ZF, the unrestricted theorem is equivalent to the axiom of choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tychonoff}\\vdash{}&\n\\forall I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\vec X(i),\\vec\\tau(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(I,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,X,\\tau)\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1336","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-tychonoff.md|58-df-tychonoff]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["b3dac4cf78c440c7","050f6d05b2c94aea","5260a5349d0b732f","36d7463d215be751"]}